    ^{:line 109 :tag bool :doc "subCarryIsBorrow is true when the actual processor carry bit used in subtraction\nis really a “borrow” bit, meaning 1 means borrow and 0 means no borrow.\nIn contrast, most systems (except x86) use a carry bit with the opposite\nmeaning: 0 means a borrow happened, and 1 means it didn't.\n"} subCarryIsBorrow




